  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>y</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt là số xe máy Lead và xe máy Vision được nhập về (với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℕ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Theo giả thiết ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>40</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>36</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>100</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math><br>Lợi nhuận thu được là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Bài toán trở thành: Tìm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>y</mi></semantics></math> để biểu thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> đạt giá trị lớn nhất.<br>Ta có miền nghiệm của hệ bất phương trình trên là tứ giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, kể cả các bờ (phần <strong>không</strong> tô màu trong hình vẽ bên) với\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"/><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"/><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>100</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"/><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tKhi đó\n\t\t\t<ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (triệu đồng).</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>520</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (triệu đồng).</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>800</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>800</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>060</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (triệu đồng).</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>400</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>400</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>280</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (triệu đồng).</li></ul></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/5ae46a4bd0c99ec881647b15bb7b6087b74c10b88979c4eec681a419626514c3.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>\n\t\t\n\t\tVậy cửa hàng thu được lợi nhuận lớn nhất là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>280</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (triệu đồng) khi nhập về <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>600</mn></semantics></math> xe máy Lead và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>400</mn></semantics></math> xe máy Vision.",
